{{!
    @template tool_vae/validation_page

    The preparation of the validation dossier, under its title, in one of three drawings: the head of every screen (the notice
    to a reader, the words "not the official dossier", the way to the deposits); the list of the records declared on; or the
    preparation of one record - its heading, the way back to the list, the notice of a record drawn without its blocs, the
    panel "where am I", then group by group (each bloc or the record as a whole, with the declarations beside it; the
    synthesis; the sections of a bloc that left the record) the sections, each with where it stands, the way to write it or
    to its history and, for a reader, its text; the way back to the dossier. The list of the records is written as
    html_writer::alist() wrote it, a line break after each item. The parts of a line touch: the template holds on logical
    lines, each break carried by a comment.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\validation_page. The template holds no logic.
    Every value is escaped (double braces) except these keys:
    * nonehtml, noticehtml - a notification drawn by the renderer of the core ('' when none)
    * headinghtml - a heading drawn by the renderer of the core ('' for a record drawn with no bloc)
    * panelhtml - the panel drawn by the template tool_vae/whereami_tree ('' when nothing is drawn)
    * statehtml - the state of the attestations, drawn by the template tool_vae/state_label
    * declarationhtml - a declaration, drawn by the template tool_vae/declaration
    * latesthtml, workinghtml - the text of a section, given by format_text() of the core as plain text

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * head - object or null: notice (object: text) or null; labelling; deposit (object: url, text) or null
    * records - object or null: intro (object: text) or null; nonehtml; list (object: choose, an object (text) or null, and
      codes, an array of {url, code}) or null; back (url, text)
    * record - object or null: headinghtml; backtolist (url, text); noticehtml; panelhtml; intro (object: text) or null;
      groups, an array of {headinghtml, declared, declarations, help, lines}; back (url, text). declared is an object (text)
      or null; declarations is null or {none, folds}: none an object (text) or null, folds an array of {start, end,
      statehtml, declarationhtml}; help is an object (text) or null. A line is {label, write, state, history, texts}: write an
      object (url) or null; history an object (url, text) or null; texts an object (latest: an object (latesthtml) or null;
      working: an object (notice, workinghtml) or null) or null

    Example context (json):
    {
        "head": {
            "notice": {"text": "This preparation is the vaeiste's own word."},
            "labelling": "Preparation - not the official dossier",
            "deposit": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/deposit.php?doctype=validation", "text": "Deposits"}
        },
        "records": {
            "intro": {"text": "Prepare your dossier record by record."},
            "nonehtml": "",
            "list": {
                "choose": {"text": "Choose a record."},
                "codes": [{"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/validation.php?fiche=RNCP100", "code": "RNCP100"}]
            },
            "back": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/dossier.php?userid=7", "text": "Back to my dossier"}
        },
        "record": {
            "headinghtml": "<h3>RNCP100</h3>",
            "backtolist": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/validation.php", "text": "Back to the records"},
            "noticehtml": "",
            "panelhtml": "",
            "intro": null,
            "groups": [
                {
                    "headinghtml": "<h4>BC01 - Bloc 1</h4>",
                    "declared": {"text": "My declarations"},
                    "declarations": {
                        "none": null,
                        "folds": [
                            {
                                "start": "5 January 2026", "end": "20 March 2026", "statehtml": "<span>Attested</span>",
                                "declarationhtml": "<div>A declaration</div>"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    "help": null,
                    "lines": [
                        {
                            "label": "Describe", "write": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/section.php"},
                            "state": "Not started", "history": null, "texts": null
                        },
                        {
                            "label": "Link", "write": null, "state": "Version 1",
                            "history": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/history.php?draftid=3", "text": "History"},
                            "texts": {
                                "latest": {"latesthtml": "<div class=\"text_to_html\">The text.</div>"},
                                "working": {"notice": "Draft in progress", "workinghtml": "<div>The draft.</div>"}
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "headinghtml": "<h4>Retired</h4>", "declared": null, "declarations": null, "help": {"text": "Kept."},
                    "lines": [{"label": "Old", "write": null, "state": "Version 2", "history": null, "texts": null}]
                }
            ],
            "back": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/dossier.php?userid=7", "text": "Back to my dossier"}
        }
    }
}}
{{#head}}{{#notice}}<div class="alert alert-info" role="note">{{text}}</div>{{/notice}}{{!
}}<div class="alert alert-info tool-vae-labelling" role="note">{{labelling}}</div>{{!
}}{{#deposit}}<p><a href="{{url}}">{{text}}</a></p>{{/deposit}}{{/head}}{{!
}}{{#records}}{{#intro}}<p>{{text}}</p>{{/intro}}{{{nonehtml}}}{{!
}}{{#list}}{{#choose}}<p>{{text}}</p>{{/choose}}<ul>
{{#codes}}<li><a href="{{url}}">{{code}}</a></li>
{{/codes}}</ul>{{/list}}{{!
}}{{#back}}<p><a href="{{url}}">{{text}}</a></p>{{/back}}{{/records}}{{!
}}{{#record}}{{{headinghtml}}}{{#backtolist}}<p><a href="{{url}}">{{text}}</a></p>{{/backtolist}}{{!
}}{{{noticehtml}}}{{{panelhtml}}}{{#intro}}<p>{{text}}</p>{{/intro}}{{!
}}{{#groups}}{{{headinghtml}}}{{#declared}}<h5 class="h6">{{text}}</h5>{{/declared}}{{!
}}{{#declarations}}{{#none}}<p class="text-muted">{{text}}</p>{{/none}}{{!
}}{{#folds}}<details class="mb-2"><summary>{{start}} - {{end}} {{{statehtml}}}</summary>{{!
}}{{{declarationhtml}}}</details>{{/folds}}{{/declarations}}{{!
}}{{#help}}<p>{{text}}</p>{{/help}}<ul>{{#lines}}{{!
}}<li>{{#write}}<a href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a>{{/write}}{{^write}}{{label}}{{/write}}{{!
}} - <span class="text-muted">{{state}}</span>{{#history}} - <a href="{{url}}">{{text}}</a>{{/history}}{{!
}}{{#texts}}{{#latest}}<div class="mb-2">{{{latesthtml}}}</div>{{/latest}}{{!
}}{{#working}}<div class="border-start ps-2 mb-2"><p class="text-muted small mb-1">{{notice}}</p>{{!
}}{{{workinghtml}}}</div>{{/working}}{{/texts}}</li>{{/lines}}</ul>{{/groups}}{{!
}}{{#back}}<p><a href="{{url}}">{{text}}</a></p>{{/back}}{{/record}}
